GENERAL INTELLIGENCE REPORT

Kingdom of Babba Sissoko (#0):
  In early winter, Khalturin was devastated by an earthquake!


Kingdom of Prometeo (#5):
  In early winter, a conquering horde owing their allegiance to Prometeo 
(#5) invaded the province of Tesawa, a Mountain area ruled by the provincial 
garrison commander.  Prometeo was in command of the invading armies.  The 
defenders were led by the provincial garrison commander.  Prometeo's host 
ended the campaign successfully and conquered Tesawa.
  In early winter, Marlon (#68) moved into Macondo.
  In fall, Ishtar (#57) travelled to Macondo.

Kingdom of Circe (#8):
  In early winter, Khalturin was devastated by an earthquake!
  In late summer, Eric (#60) moved into Transylvania.
  In fall, Eric journeyed to Abu Matariq.  Eric discovered a feature in Abu 
Matariq: a Catacombs inhabited by the Hydra.  Eric discovered a heretofore 
unknown Tower in Abu Matariq, inhabited by the Witch.
  In early winter, Eric informed Eric that Eric was no longer an useful 
asset to the King, and relieved Eric of his duties.
  In early summer, Aegir (#66) rode into Transylvania.
  In late summer, Aegir travelled to Kiska.


Kingdom of Agesilao (#9):
  In early winter, Agesilao (#9)'s minions initiated a campaign of conquest 
directed at Apurimac, a Desert province owing allegiance to Jolin (#37).  
Negumba (#98) was in command of the attacking armies.  The defending forces 
were led by Jolin (#37).  Negumba (#98)'s campaign accomplished the conquest 
of Apurimac.


